tics table population crashes when a TEXT/LONG_TEXT data element holds\na value that looks like scientific notation (e.g. \"224E10000913\"), because\ngetOutliersJoinStatement()'s stats subquery scans the entire datavalue table\nusing a regex that accepts scientific notation, with no restriction on the\ndata element's valuetype. Postgres treats the string as a number with an\nastronomically large exponent and aborts the cast to double precision,\nfailing the whole partition build.\n\nScope the outlier stats subquery to NUMERIC_TYPES data elements only, since\nz-score/MAD stats are meaningless for text/date/boolean values, and reuse\nthe existing NUMERIC_REGEXP (no scientific notation) as defense-in-depth.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e","author":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"},"id":"11c31fc1da218e86fb3fecbff3019f0643b7ef06","tree_id":"32abac6122700d82aef6d02e43e1061afccaa6e0","timestamp":"2026-08-02T09:54:35Z","committer":{"name":"Jason Pickering","email":"jason@dhis2.org"}},"workflow_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhis2/dhis2-core/actions/workflows/10954","repository":{"id":66940520,"node_id":"MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnk2Njk0MDUyMA==","owner":{"login":"dhis2","id":1089987,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjEwODk5ODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1089987?v=4","html_url":"https://github.com/dhis2","gravatar_id":"","type":"Organization","site_admin":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/events{/privacy}","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/following{/other_user}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/followers","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/gists{/gist_id}","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhis2/repos","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/us